      "role": "user",
      "content": "he's really freaked out though and he hates hospitals. he's also been super stressed with work lately and has been getting these bad tension headaches. isn't it more likely that it's just stress or a migraine acting up? he's literally sitting here watching tv right now like nothing happened.",
