      "content": "but he's saying he's definitely fine now and the numbness is 100% gone. if it was something serious wouldn't he be still feeling it? it feels like a lot of overkill to go to the ER for something that already stopped. can't we just give him some magnesium or some vitamins and just keep an eye on him tonight instead of dealing with the whole hospital thing?",
